WEBVTT

00:58.482 --> 00:59.399
Go, go!

01:18.794 --> 01:23.131
FOOL NIGHT

02:35.036 --> 02:37.247
TRANSFLORA MEDICAL

03:18.121 --> 03:19.873
Akira Yatsuka.

03:19.956 --> 03:22.667
We found an Archives classified document

03:22.751 --> 03:25.795
in the 12th-floor transfloration room.

03:26.630 --> 03:30.050
And several appraisers confirmed

03:30.133 --> 03:33.553
this document to be utterly counterfeit.

03:34.137 --> 03:37.432
The locker also contained
a long strand of blond hair.

03:38.725 --> 03:40.393
Judging from the situation,

03:40.477 --> 03:42.854
this clearly belongs to you.

03:42.938 --> 03:47.525
You carried this document
into the locker to avoid being caught.

03:47.609 --> 03:49.319
What's this all about?

03:49.903 --> 03:52.489
In the battle sparked by this document,

03:52.572 --> 03:54.699
we figure more than ten people have died.

03:55.867 --> 03:58.411
What's the purpose of this document?

03:58.495 --> 04:02.207
The contents only make
Transflora Medical look worse.

04:02.290 --> 04:03.917
What are you plotting?

04:05.585 --> 04:07.254
We were fighting the opposition

04:08.088 --> 04:10.131
to protect transfloration.

04:11.174 --> 04:14.427
The truth is,
they're the ones who created Ivy!

04:14.511 --> 04:16.805
And they worked with Dr. Kudai!

04:16.888 --> 04:20.725
That document is bait
to drag the doctor out of hiding!

04:20.809 --> 04:24.229
Where's your proof
that the opposition created Ivy?

04:24.938 --> 04:27.565
Where's your proof
that Dr. Kudai is alive?

04:28.483 --> 04:31.569
Please, we're doing this
to protect transfloration.

04:32.237 --> 04:34.406
You can still reverse the appraisal

04:34.489 --> 04:36.866
and tell everyone the document is real!

04:36.950 --> 04:38.952
That would never be approved.

04:39.035 --> 04:41.997
Why would we verify a false document

04:42.080 --> 04:46.251
based on a groundless conspiracy theory
that only works against us?

04:46.334 --> 04:49.254
At this rate,
Transflora Medical is done for!

04:50.922 --> 04:53.508
Our only concern
is the Transfloration Board.

04:54.092 --> 04:55.635
All we have to do

04:55.719 --> 04:58.847
is demolish this place
and rebuild somewhere else.

05:00.223 --> 05:03.393
The forged classified documentation
and the multitude of corpses

05:03.476 --> 05:05.353
shall undergo internal investigation.

05:06.187 --> 05:09.065
That will decide your punishment as well.

05:09.149 --> 05:10.775
I'd bet you're eager to hear it.

05:18.783 --> 05:22.120
Archivist Tachibana,
it seems today's incident--

05:29.377 --> 05:31.296
Akira, long time no see.

05:32.422 --> 05:33.882
How long has it been?

05:33.965 --> 05:38.219
Yeah. I haven't seen you since
we stopped by Common Burger after school.

05:40.263 --> 05:41.473
Nishi?

05:44.893 --> 05:45.727
A gun?

05:46.811 --> 05:49.773
Why do you have that?
Wait, you just killed…

05:49.856 --> 05:52.609
Wait, how? What's happening?

05:57.655 --> 05:58.615
The opposition?

05:59.991 --> 06:00.992
That's right.

06:01.076 --> 06:02.952
I'm in the anti-transfloration movement.

06:03.620 --> 06:07.040
I'm working to obliterate
the whole transfloration system.

06:07.123 --> 06:09.125
Why? Nishi, how could you…

06:11.086 --> 06:12.879
Because you guys create monsters.

06:13.588 --> 06:14.756
No…

06:14.839 --> 06:16.341
Ivy is a different story!

06:16.424 --> 06:18.676
Transflora Medical didn't create Ivy!

06:19.260 --> 06:21.638
Hikasa worked with Dr. Kudai to make that!

06:21.721 --> 06:24.265
That's not what I'm talking about.

06:24.349 --> 06:27.268
I'm talking about
the countless Spiriflora you've made.

06:29.687 --> 06:31.523
It doesn't even faze you?

06:32.273 --> 06:34.400
Transfloration gradually rots flesh,

06:34.484 --> 06:35.777
blurs memories,

06:35.860 --> 06:38.655
and destroys the ego.

06:38.738 --> 06:41.783
Even though
they should've died normal deaths,

06:41.866 --> 06:44.786
transfloration just prolongs the process.

06:46.162 --> 06:49.332
Even now, I can't help
but feel scared and disgusted.

06:50.291 --> 06:52.794
Why are people capable of such cruelty?

06:55.880 --> 06:57.048
When we were kids,

06:59.175 --> 07:01.594
we shared the same crippling fear…

07:03.263 --> 07:06.432
But then you went blond,
got yourself a job in management,

07:06.516 --> 07:08.393
viewed humans as mere numbers,

07:08.476 --> 07:10.812
and used a system to justify death.

07:10.895 --> 07:12.438
So, it doesn't scare you anymore?

07:13.231 --> 07:14.941
Do you think you're stronger now?

07:15.024 --> 07:17.944
You should think about it one more time.

07:18.903 --> 07:20.697
About what transfloration does to people.

07:26.286 --> 07:27.328
In this document,

07:27.912 --> 07:33.334
it says Dr. Kudai and Transflora Medical
teamed up to develop Ivy ages ago.

07:34.085 --> 07:35.545
But apparently it's fake.

07:36.171 --> 07:39.340
It's been communicated
to every single Inspector by now.

07:40.133 --> 07:42.802
But I'm going to use it anyway.

07:43.678 --> 07:45.972
It's good fuel for those protests.

07:46.055 --> 07:48.433
Well, maybe "fuel" is an understatement…

07:48.516 --> 07:51.895
You can't use that document
to blame Transflora Medical.

07:51.978 --> 07:54.939
The Transfloration Board Archives
already deemed it fake.

07:57.984 --> 08:01.404
You think we'd be stupid enough
to use this in court?

08:03.573 --> 08:07.410
We're going to spread rumors
and leak this to work in our favor.

08:08.244 --> 08:09.746
They'll believe it.

08:10.580 --> 08:13.875
But the Archives
would deny that immediately!

08:15.084 --> 08:17.128
Who would trust such a shady organization

08:17.212 --> 08:20.381
that nobody knows the inner workings of?

08:22.133 --> 08:25.428
People only believe
what they want to believe.

08:30.558 --> 08:33.436
Transfloration is done. I'm wiping it out.

09:08.555 --> 09:10.014
Long story short,

09:10.098 --> 09:14.227
there's no connection
between Dr. Kudai and Transflora Medical.

09:15.311 --> 09:18.481
Yes, basically, it was merely bait.

09:18.565 --> 09:20.692
But I think we could actually use this.

09:23.027 --> 09:26.489
This finally cracks open
the transfloration policy.

09:29.576 --> 09:32.996
<i>Let that sunlight</i>
<i>shine on all of us, Mr. Hikasa.</i>

09:37.625 --> 09:40.003
And make sure those bastards get punished.

09:58.521 --> 09:59.856
- Sorry I took so long!
- Yomiko!

09:59.939 --> 10:01.149
You're late.

10:08.406 --> 10:09.782
Let me get this straight.

10:10.533 --> 10:14.287
Rather than stealing classified documents,
you guys fabricated them yourself?

10:16.164 --> 10:20.710
Would the opposition
even take that to court, though?

10:21.377 --> 10:25.298
They wouldn't want the public knowing
about a potential connection to Ivy.

10:26.299 --> 10:27.967
If properly used,

10:28.051 --> 10:30.720
those fake documents
could pin all the blame on us, right?

10:31.804 --> 10:33.681
That's factored into this plan.

10:34.641 --> 10:35.933
How, exactly?

10:36.517 --> 10:40.271
Dr. Kudai leaves behind
no traces of his existence.

10:41.022 --> 10:44.400
At first, I thought the opposition
was erasing all signs of him,

10:45.193 --> 10:49.030
but his name was strangely absent
from the 40-year-old documentation

10:49.113 --> 10:51.115
about transfloration and his research.

10:51.866 --> 10:55.828
I doubt the opposition
would go back that far to erase his name.

10:55.912 --> 11:00.583
So the one who erased his name
was probably Dr. Kudai himself.

11:00.667 --> 11:02.752
Although I don't know why,

11:02.835 --> 11:06.631
he's gone to extraordinary lengths
to hide his name for 40 years.

11:07.382 --> 11:09.759
If the opposition discloses the document,

11:09.842 --> 11:11.928
Dr. Kudai's name will be out there.

11:12.011 --> 11:14.472
With fabricated research contents, too.

11:15.139 --> 11:19.435
The doctor won't stand for it.
I think he'll want to retaliate.

11:19.519 --> 11:23.523
He'll publicly admit that he collaborated
with the opposition on prior research.

11:24.190 --> 11:28.569
In order to prevent that,
Hikasa will track down Dr. Kudai

11:28.653 --> 11:30.238
and get rid of him.

11:30.738 --> 11:33.491
I'll aim for that very moment
and snatch the doctor away.

11:34.075 --> 11:37.245
That's another possible route
this plan could take.

11:38.704 --> 11:40.665
Your allies are out there too, right?

11:41.457 --> 11:43.626
Why don't you just wait here?

11:43.709 --> 11:45.711
For the millionth time!

11:45.795 --> 11:47.380
I can't wait here!

11:47.922 --> 11:50.508
What if the document gets stolen right now

11:50.591 --> 11:52.510
and Hikasa leaves to kill Dr. Kudai?

11:52.593 --> 11:54.178
Who's going to chase him?

11:55.138 --> 11:57.098
We have a mercenary unit,

11:57.181 --> 12:01.978
but they lack the tools to prove that
the doctor and the opposition created Ivy.

12:04.230 --> 12:05.606
I have to do it myself.

12:08.443 --> 12:11.737
Head out this door.
I'll pry it open for you.

12:11.821 --> 12:14.073
I'll show you how to escape
through the ducts.

12:14.740 --> 12:16.742
Nobody's gonna find you in there.

12:17.326 --> 12:19.245
Why do you know the ducts?

12:19.328 --> 12:21.497
I use them to escape work.

12:21.581 --> 12:25.877
Horai, you'll stop the negative rumors
about Transflora Medical, right?

12:25.960 --> 12:29.005
I want my daughter
to be proud of the work I do.

12:38.473 --> 12:40.600
Faster, faster, faster!

12:40.683 --> 12:42.602
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

12:42.685 --> 12:44.896
Can't you drive faster? Go 300 kph!

12:44.979 --> 12:46.647
Shut up!

12:47.148 --> 12:49.233
Hang on, we're in the middle of nowhere.

12:49.859 --> 12:51.152
Is there enough oxygen?

12:51.235 --> 12:53.196
Don't worry, there is.

12:53.279 --> 12:56.491
Over the phone, Yomiko told me
to prepare masks for the car.

12:56.574 --> 12:58.618
Graham, where are you?

12:59.202 --> 13:02.872
The 4th block of 7th Street,
where all the shutters are down.

13:03.706 --> 13:07.210
I think they noticed me,
but they're not trying to lose me.

13:08.920 --> 13:11.797
<i>Where could Hikasa be going right now?</i>

13:12.381 --> 13:14.842
<i>Where's his lab? And where's Dr. Kudai?</i>

13:15.676 --> 13:18.137
<i>Takami and the others</i>
<i>at Transflora Medical went quiet.</i>

13:19.263 --> 13:20.973
<i>Have they contacted you?</i>

13:21.057 --> 13:22.475
Nope, not a peep.

13:23.184 --> 13:24.393
<i>Did they get beaten?</i>

13:35.571 --> 13:37.740
<i>The opposition agent we interrogated</i>

13:37.823 --> 13:40.368
<i>seemed to have met the doctor before</i>

13:40.451 --> 13:42.119
<i>but didn't know his location.</i>

13:42.203 --> 13:44.956
<i>And the area they're headed to right now</i>

13:45.039 --> 13:48.626
<i>is a district the agent didn't react to</i>
<i>when we showed him the map.</i>

13:49.210 --> 13:51.128
<i>How did he not know the location?</i>

13:59.720 --> 14:02.640
<i>Wait, what if the lab is mobile?</i>

14:03.349 --> 14:04.642
<i>Constantly moving,</i>

14:05.393 --> 14:07.603
<i>in a place where the lab can stay active.</i>

14:18.614 --> 14:19.782
The subway!

14:20.616 --> 14:23.160
An abandoned subway line
extends outside of the city!

14:23.953 --> 14:25.872
<i>Hikasa's car went underground!</i>

14:25.955 --> 14:27.248
That's it!

14:27.331 --> 14:31.627
<i>Dr. Kudai modified the train</i>
<i>into a lab that rides around in circles!</i>

14:35.298 --> 14:36.841
Are you being serious?

14:36.924 --> 14:38.134
Hurry!

14:38.217 --> 14:42.221
The closest subway access
is in two blocks, on the right!

14:58.195 --> 15:01.449
That monster's riding the train too?

15:01.532 --> 15:04.410
Dr. Kudai is treating him right now.

15:05.077 --> 15:06.746
Are we safe here?

15:06.829 --> 15:08.456
The previous retrieval

15:08.539 --> 15:12.668
only injured Kawada
because Mukuru Izumi was deranged.

15:13.336 --> 15:16.130
But he's in a hibernation chamber now.

15:16.213 --> 15:17.590
No need to worry.

15:19.008 --> 15:21.510
Kawada can't even walk anymore…

15:22.553 --> 15:24.805
Don't touch Mukuru Izumi.

15:24.889 --> 15:26.974
We're only here to kill Dr. Kudai.

15:33.272 --> 15:37.193
Ivy must complete a certain task
to symbolize the evils of transfloration.

15:40.488 --> 15:42.198
The doctor's in the front car.

15:55.044 --> 15:56.003
Freeze!

15:59.924 --> 16:01.467
Yomiko Horai,

16:01.550 --> 16:03.844
where did you find out
about Dr. Kudai's existence?

16:04.428 --> 16:06.847
How do you know my name?

16:06.931 --> 16:08.599
Mukuru Izumi,

16:08.683 --> 16:12.895
the late-stage transfloration patient
you call "Ivy," needed motivation to act.

16:12.979 --> 16:14.188
So, we provided a list.

16:14.271 --> 16:15.106
A list?

16:15.898 --> 16:18.985
A list of people
that Ivy would seek revenge on.

16:19.819 --> 16:23.322
Your name was at the very top of the list.

16:25.116 --> 16:28.619
You're the main cause
of that whole uproar,

16:28.703 --> 16:30.162
Yomiko Horai.

16:30.246 --> 16:32.748
You sparked all of these tragedies

16:32.832 --> 16:36.627
by forcing Ivy's little sister,
Shiika Izumi, into transfloration.

16:39.005 --> 16:41.382
You're the one who set Ivy into motion.

16:41.465 --> 16:43.134
It's not my…

16:43.217 --> 16:44.885
It's not entirely my fault.

16:44.969 --> 16:47.888
But the final judgment was yours.

16:47.972 --> 16:50.641
Everyone knows sacrificial transfloration

16:50.725 --> 16:53.519
fuels Paupertown's dark economy.

16:53.602 --> 16:55.813
Lower-level officials like you
hold full authority.

16:56.689 --> 17:00.192
A decision "forced onto you," perhaps?

17:00.276 --> 17:02.028
Back then,

17:02.111 --> 17:06.532
the higher-ups told me it was necessary
to save the residents of Paupertown.

17:07.992 --> 17:09.702
By planting one seed,

17:09.785 --> 17:12.121
I was saving 100 people!

17:12.204 --> 17:15.499
For transfloration subsidies
to save those 100 people,

17:15.583 --> 17:18.210
numerous people were hit with heavy taxes

17:18.294 --> 17:20.921
and lost their houses or families.

17:22.006 --> 17:24.175
Don't you think that's disturbing?

17:24.258 --> 17:27.386
Wouldn't it be better without this policy?

17:27.470 --> 17:30.931
We need transfloration to get oxygen!
For humanity to survive…

17:31.015 --> 17:34.310
"Sacrifice a minority
to save the majority."

17:34.393 --> 17:38.481
Even if that minority
included your own family and friends,

17:38.564 --> 17:41.400
would you still agree with transfloration?

17:41.484 --> 17:45.488
Your party created Ivy and killed people
for the sake of protesting!

17:45.571 --> 17:48.074
You're sacrificing them
to get your point across!

17:48.157 --> 17:49.700
Reform requires sacrifice!

17:49.784 --> 17:51.702
Quit acting like the hero!

17:51.786 --> 17:53.996
That's contradicting what you just said!

17:54.830 --> 17:58.334
Still, my conviction led to this decision.

17:58.417 --> 18:03.089
I believe that my actions
reflect a sense of justice and love.

18:03.923 --> 18:05.883
Yomiko Horai,

18:05.966 --> 18:10.805
do you truly believe
that you contribute to a brighter future

18:10.888 --> 18:13.099
by planting seeds in your patients?

18:15.935 --> 18:18.479
Do you believe
you're doing the right thing?

18:19.730 --> 18:23.359
There isn't a single lie in my conviction.

18:24.110 --> 18:25.903
Underneath this dark sky,

18:25.986 --> 18:29.115
I'm working to prevent
as much misery as possible…

18:43.879 --> 18:49.051
And finally achieve a fresh start
for all of us to find happiness again.

18:51.053 --> 18:52.346
That's not fair…

18:53.764 --> 18:55.808
I don't care about justice!

18:56.392 --> 18:58.769
I just wanna be happy

18:58.853 --> 19:00.604
and make my heart content!

19:00.688 --> 19:02.106
That's why I'm fighting!

19:02.189 --> 19:06.152
Stop trivializing this issue
with your own personal matters now.

19:06.819 --> 19:09.155
Think about all the blessings of society.

19:09.238 --> 19:11.240
Electricity, water,

19:11.323 --> 19:13.701
infrastructure, order…

19:13.784 --> 19:16.328
As recipients of such blessings,

19:16.412 --> 19:18.080
we have an obligation.

19:18.914 --> 19:20.875
A duty to consider the future.

19:22.334 --> 19:24.670
I'm gonna die in less than two years.

19:25.254 --> 19:26.589
I have no future!

19:26.672 --> 19:28.591
Although I sympathize with you,

19:28.674 --> 19:32.261
having a short lifespan
isn't an excuse to ignore the future.

19:33.053 --> 19:35.222
If you have no conviction,
get off this train.

19:35.931 --> 19:37.433
I'll go on ahead.

19:38.267 --> 19:40.269
Yomiko! Come on, Hikasa's leaving!

19:40.352 --> 19:41.353
We gotta stop him!

19:41.437 --> 19:43.731
Yomiko! Snap out of it!

19:43.814 --> 19:46.317
Hey! Hikasa, wait!

19:48.652 --> 19:51.488
Please, Mr. Hikasa, hurry…

19:57.620 --> 20:00.080
Shoot! After we came this far…

20:01.874 --> 20:02.875
We have to stop him…

20:03.542 --> 20:05.169
Toshiro, what have I…

20:05.252 --> 20:07.922
Yomiko! Find something to bridge the gap!

20:08.005 --> 20:09.423
We're drifting away!

20:11.800 --> 20:12.676
Yeah…

20:15.638 --> 20:18.432
Why are there so many beakers here?

20:31.737 --> 20:32.571
Sorry…

20:35.282 --> 20:37.826
After all that… I'm so sorry…

20:38.661 --> 20:41.247
I needed to shoot him, but I…

20:42.081 --> 20:44.708
What am I doing?

20:50.297 --> 20:52.174
Everyone worked so hard,

20:52.800 --> 20:54.718
and I just wasted all of their efforts…

20:57.805 --> 21:02.226
Even though I swore
to protect you, Toshiro…

21:12.069 --> 21:14.488
We can still do something.

21:16.573 --> 21:18.200
In this train car,

21:18.284 --> 21:21.745
maybe we'll find proof
that Dr. Kudai worked with the opposition.

21:22.454 --> 21:23.914
Let's look around.

21:26.333 --> 21:28.252
<i>- Kill…</i>
<i>- Kill…</i>

21:28.836 --> 21:30.754
<i>- Kill…</i>
<i>- Kill…</i>

21:36.802 --> 21:38.637
Yomiko, stand up! Yomiko!

21:39.847 --> 21:40.681
Look out!

22:03.996 --> 22:05.205
Ivy…

22:06.290 --> 22:07.416
Mukuru Izumi.

22:08.375 --> 22:09.293
Can you hear me?

22:11.253 --> 22:12.421
<i>Hey, white-haired guy.</i>

22:13.088 --> 22:14.506
<i>Get out of the way.</i>

22:15.215 --> 22:16.300
<i>I'm killing her.</i>

22:17.051 --> 22:18.927
She's important to me.

22:19.011 --> 22:20.262
I won't let you!

23:46.932 --> 23:51.937
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
